INSERT INTO `blog` (`id`, `category`, `content`, `cover_image`, `created_at`, `published`, `title`, `updated_at`, `author_id`) VALUES
(UNHEX(REPLACE('376f2180-fecf-43b5-91c9-6d2f23b381aa', '-', '')), 'Health & Fitness', '<p>In modern life, many people spend long hours sitting at desks, using mobile devices, or working in front of computers. This sedentary lifestyle can lead to various health issues such as obesity, back pain, and low energy levels. Regular exercise is one of the most effective ways to combat these problems and maintain a healthy lifestyle.</p>
INSERT INTO `blog` (`id`, `category`, `content`, `cover_image`, `created_at`, `published`, `title`, `updated_at`, `author_id`) VALUES
(UNHEX(REPLACE('6c0d2e10-d02a-4452-bbf8-e2ef456ff9f7', '-', '')), 'Nutrition', '<p>Fitness is not only about working out; nutrition plays an equally important role. Without proper nutrition, it is difficult to achieve fitness goals such as weight loss or muscle gain. A balanced diet provides the energy and nutrients needed for effective workouts and recovery.</p>
INSERT INTO `blog` (`id`, `category`, `content`, `cover_image`, `created_at`, `published`, `title`, `updated_at`, `author_id`) VALUES
(UNHEX(REPLACE('87cd9cff-ca30-4c74-b280-0f042bc1e9fd', '-', '')), 'Weight Loss', '<p>Losing weight is one of the most common fitness goals, but many people struggle to achieve it due to lack of proper knowledge and consistency. Weight loss is not about starving yourself or following extreme diets—it is about maintaining a balanced lifestyle.</p>
INSERT INTO `blog` (`id`, `category`, `content`, `cover_image`, `created_at`, `published`, `title`, `updated_at`, `author_id`) VALUES
(UNHEX(REPLACE('7fb9bbe9-0272-4d03-9451-284ae859a326', '-', '')), 'Fitness Tips', '<p>A daily workout routine can bring numerous benefits to your life, both physically and mentally. Even a short session of exercise every day can make a significant difference.</p>
INSERT INTO `blog` (`id`, `category`, `content`, `cover_image`, `created_at`, `published`, `title`, `updated_at`, `author_id`) VALUES
(UNHEX(REPLACE('0640931f-f99a-4108-b7b8-02ff7bb96bde', '-', '')), 'Lifestyle', '<p>Many people treat fitness as a short-term goal, such as losing weight for an event or gaining muscle quickly. However, true fitness is a lifelong journey that requires consistency and dedication.</p>
